Brunswick County","/arc-plc/north-carolina/brunswick-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 29% of normal on the middle of the grids, and June to July at 60%. Grid 16709 had its driest year in 2007, at 50% of normal.</p>"}
